{"id":"f2b5b6ad45b10aef","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-splitting-density.md","title":"Density with Simultaneous Meet and Join Splitting","display":"thm-degree-splitting-density — Density with Simultaneous Meet and Join Splitting","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-splitting-density","aliases":["67-thm-degree-splitting-density"],"display":"thm-degree-splitting-density — Density with Simultaneous Meet and Join Splitting","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§1","source_label":"Theorem 7.2","source_printed_pages":[95,96],"source_pdf_pages":[106,107],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"book-proof-read; earlier-chapter auxiliary proof chain not independently audited","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-splitting-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-splitting-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-splitting-density — Density with Simultaneous Meet and Join Splitting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 7.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>95</span><span>96</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>106</span><span>107</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"book-proof-read; earlier-chapter auxiliary proof chain not independently audited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf1_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf1_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\">\\(\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,d_0,d_1\\in D_T\">\\(a,b,d_0,d_1\\in D_T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nleq_T\">\\(\\nleq_T\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 的否定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\ \\land\\ d_0\\nleq_Ta\\ \\land\\ b\\nleq_Td_1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists c_0,c_1\\in D_T\\;\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}(a&lt;_Tc_i&lt;_Tb\\land d_0\\nleq_Tc_i\\land c_i\\nleq_Td_1)\\land c_0\\wedge_Tc_1=a\\land c_0\\vee_Tc_1=b\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\ \\land\\ d_0\\nleq_Ta\\ \\land\\ b\\nleq_Td_1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists c_0,c_1\\in D_T\\;\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}(a&lt;_Tc_i&lt;_Tb\\land d_0\\nleq_Tc_i\\land c_i\\nleq_Td_1)\\land c_0\\wedge_Tc_1=a\\land c_0\\vee_Tc_1=b\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;\\left(a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists c\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_Tc&lt;_Tb)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;\\left(a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists c\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_Tc&lt;_Tb)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书第7章定理2（印刷95–96页，PDF106–107页）。原书图像明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_0\\nleq a\">\\(d_0\\nleq a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\nleq d_1\">\\(b\\nleq d_1\\)</span>，结论对两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i\">\\(c_i\\)</span> 同时保持这两侧不可比较方向；OCR 会把否定序号误读。此处逐项对照了页面图像。</p>\n<p>第二式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_0=b,d_1=a\">\\(d_0=b,d_1=a\\)</span> 即由第一式推出。只导出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b&lt;\\mathbf1_T\">\\(b&lt;\\mathbf1_T\\)</span> 的书面适用范围，不自行扩展至顶端区间。旧偏序文件 Remark 曾称解释度不稠密，与本章定理矛盾；现由此单独原子给出准确结论。</p>\n<p>已阅读定理2及引理5的书面构造：通过两句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句分裂、Orey 紧致性与度格分配律实现共同交并。本次没有独立核验第5–6章辅助定理的完整证明链。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]，$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 按 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]，$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 按 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_T,\\vee_T","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,d_0,d_1\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\nleq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&a<_Tb<_T\\mathbf1_T\\ \\land\\ d_0\\nleq_Ta\\ \\land\\ b\\nleq_Td_1\\\\\n&\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists c_0,c_1\\in D_T\\;\\left(\\bigwedge_{i<2}(a<_Tc_i<_Tb\\land d_0\\nleq_Tc_i\\land c_i\\nleq_Td_1)\\land c_0\\wedge_Tc_1=a\\land c_0\\vee_Tc_1=b\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;\\left(a<_Tb<_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists c\\in D_T\\;(a<_Tc<_Tb)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"d_0\\nleq a","display":false},{"tex":"b\\nleq d_1","display":false},{"tex":"c_i","display":false},{"tex":"d_0=b,d_1=a","display":false},{"tex":"b<\\mathbf1_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false}],"bytes":2196,"backlinks":[{"id":"89eac554f6aa8842","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"旧文件的无来源 $\\mathrm{Poset}$ 原语已展开为三条量化公理。本原子不承担密度结论；书中确实存在密度